  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Admission of Refugees with the Government of Germany from the Republic of T&#xfc;rkiye in 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a commitment to the EU commission for resettlement and humanitarian admission, Germany has pledged to receive a total of 6,500 beneficiaries of international protection over the course of 2023 through different admission schemes. Under this project, IOM is supporting its partner, the Federal Office for Migration and Refugees (BAMF) to contribute to providing a durable solution to 3,000 Syrian beneficiaries in T&#xfc;rkiye by facilitating their humanitarian admission to Germany.</narrative>
  </description>
